  dialogue_phrases:
  - portraits: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2494d3a8744c1924a8cf309e7d2a5d0f, type: 3}
    dialogueTexts: "...not another party of adventurers out on the king\u2019s quest.
      Listen I\u2019d advise you to leave before you even think of going anywhere
      else. Just make your way out the door and out of ChaosKeep. Go find love, plow
      a farm, anything! Just get\u2026!"
  - portraits: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2494d3a8744c1924a8cf309e7d2a5d0f, type: 3}
    dialogueTexts: "Oh hells\u2026 Well there\u2019s your Duke! Been nice knowin\u2019ya!
      Get a room at least before you die, one final rest and some gold to our purses."
  - portraits: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e78f8b2b22c138418b82972c188c268, type: 3}
    dialogueTexts: Hand me the missive or go on your way like the wench said.
